      <title>明道云办首届Real AI Contest，比拼企业AI真实落地</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260819/%E6%98%8E%E9%81%93%E4%BA%91%E5%8A%9E%E9%A6%96%E5%B1%8AReal-AI-Contest%E6%AF%94%E6%8B%BC%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9AAI%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0/</link>
